sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You
    participant A as Ekagrachit.app
    participant H as ekagrachit-host
    participant E as Extension
    participant C as Chrome
    U->>A: Start Focus (URL, 25 min)
    A->>A: idle → preparing · persist deadline
    A->>H: sync {session, phase: preparing}
    H->>E: (relay)
    E->>C: windows.create(popup) · install DNR rules
    E->>H: window_ready {windowId, tabId, bounds}
    H->>A: (relay)
    A->>A: locate native window (browser pid + bounds)
    A->>A: show overlays · start focus loop
    A->>E: sync {phase: active} (via host)
    Note over A,E: sync is full desired state: re-sent on every change,<br/>every 10 s and on reconnect · a stale (epoch, seq) is ignored
    U-->>C: tries a link to Jira
    C-->>E: blocked before the request (DNR)
    E->>A: violation {host} → pill: "Saved for later"
